  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Blapl/1726/2021 on 4 June, 2021",
    "facts": "This is an application under Section 439 Cr.P.C. for grant of bail to the Petitioner Trilochan Sahoo @ Tilia in connection with Malgodown P.S. Case No.222 of 2020 corresponding to G.R. Case No.1346 of 2020 pending in the court of learned J.M.F.C.(City), Cuttack for alleged commission of offence under Sections 420/272/273/34 of the Indian Penal Code, read with Section 51/52/56/57/59/63 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and Section 16 of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act. It is submitted that the allegations are relating to preparation of adulterated chili powder and turmeric powder and the Petitioner is inside custody since 2nd February, 2021. It is also submitted that in the meantime investigation has been completed and the Petitioner being a permanent resident under Purighat P.S., there is no chance of his absconding.",
